3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=147229e03bf26a8d33017e855bf9e887 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "今までのFFXIVの作品が大好きで、私のFFXIVのサブキャラクターを描いていただけたらと思います。顔の表情は中性的なものを希望しますが、それ以外はお任せします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/BJPUzWI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wka_hko/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ee98aa9/uploads/origins/77783228-17b2-479e-9dd8-f859e642fe5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=553f172d3c95338f30a07bdfa560a972", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ee98aa9/uploads/origins/77783228-17b2-479e-9dd8-f859e642fe5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=553f172d3c95338f30a07bdfa560a972, https://si.imgix.net/3ee98aa9/uploads/origins/77783228-17b2-479e-9dd8-f859e642fe5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0f7fc366d9ec0b9e34e90aba6f2042a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ee98aa9/uploads/origins/77783228-17b2-479e-9dd8-f859e642fe5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48a6eb8cb2ac98034c04128a0bc2f775 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "WKAHKOさん、はじめまして。もしよろしければ、キャラクター依頼のリクエストを出したいと思います。イラストを描いて欲しいキャラクターは2人です。その他、ポーズやシナリオなど細かいことはお任せします。お時間を割いていただきありがとうございました。\n\nモデル参考資料です。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1f0cVfthCIaTDpUP9tVvx5KHDa7fpD_l9?usp=sharing（♂182cm）。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16miPnQaVAVyQ4wruc4bpOFFj4cCM3Aaa?usp=sharing (♀ 170 cm)\n\n図版参照。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Y-PmYwv823vKzFsjI1JEftB2vLSRk70B", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wka_hko/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5926602e/uploads/origins/ab9bda71-6e7d-49dd-95cf-e95117353e09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b558d73e151457a11dfd7ddc88807b3d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5926602e/uploads/origins/ab9bda71-6e7d-49dd-95cf-e95117353e09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b558d73e151457a11dfd7ddc88807b3d, https://si.imgix.net/5926602e/uploads/origins/ab9bda71-6e7d-49dd-95cf-e95117353e09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97720b7d1dc68fc48b9750fbf8f2fd0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5926602e/uploads/origins/ab9bda71-6e7d-49dd-95cf-e95117353e09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=848510420c92a16d528ec759d96bac3c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\nWKAHKO先生が描かれるイラスト、\n女の子が格好良くて好きです。\n以下のようなリクエストをお送りします。\n\nVtuberの「一ノ瀬うるは」\n\n服装や構図等についてはお任せしますが、\nへそ出しのトップスで\nへそピアスをつけてください。\n\n以前描かれていたティファのイラストのように、\n引き締まった腹筋にしていただきたいです。\n\nその他、不明点はご自由に描いていただければと思います。\n\n以上となります。\n検討していただけますと幸いです。\n\nご参考として、キャラクターデザイン担当した方のイラストです。\nhttps://twitter.com/atikix/status/1454423710945841156", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wka_hko/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db56f5b5/uploads/origins/9243aaa3-c9f3-445d-937e-8da005e05cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cda0e7ff7952e505b57dbdfb8c19b102", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db56f5b5/uploads/origins/9243aaa3-c9f3-445d-937e-8da005e05cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cda0e7ff7952e505b57dbdfb8c19b102, https://si.imgix.net/db56f5b5/uploads/origins/9243aaa3-c9f3-445d-937e-8da005e05cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10803480eca8ef2d844c8a1392a1a956 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db56f5b5/uploads/origins/9243aaa3-c9f3-445d-937e-8da005e05cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c8acbe51f84dc83684d5f7a38c6be62 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! Really love your art! Could you draw me and my friend's characters please? I'd like a bunny suit themed piece! Please have them both in bunny suits and in a pose together, something like this https://i.imgur.com/dT3Btks.png or https://i.imgur.com/oBxP7Hj.png would work but i'll leave the composition up to you! Feel free to be creative in the pose. Thanks for the consideration!\n\nReference: https://imgur.com/a/OidubMC\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/OidubMC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wka_hko/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd0e9a66/uploads/origins/ef63aa63-6f89-4f7c-83e5-0a875e8a954d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9722bc1e69e94ce3a2a8b3f5a2d7f68", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd0e9a66/uploads/origins/ef63aa63-6f89-4f7c-83e5-0a875e8a954d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9722bc1e69e94ce3a2a8b3f5a2d7f68, https://si.imgix.net/cd0e9a66/uploads/origins/ef63aa63-6f89-4f7c-83e5-0a875e8a954d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95f6342ef9a8e3e973d769aba4b118ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd0e9a66/uploads/origins/ef63aa63-6f89-4f7c-83e5-0a875e8a954d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccb46d87615c37591c3d7524f5b9a04a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI love your style and would like to request a commission of my FFXIV OC, Silver, if possible! I have included references and an outfit. Feel free to exclude the sword.\n\nI'd like her to have an alluring expression and a pose to match. I'd also like her to be looking at the viewer as well. Besides those two requests, I'll leave the rest up to you!\n\nNotes:\nAn additional folder with skin color references is included.\nThe tips of her hair have red highlights.\nNails are painted red.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1SUkEiM5buo_yZMInjKEiWHL3Vib9hBsV", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wka_hko/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/15cff8a8/uploads/origins/dece028c-d3a9-48e7-bf02-a735f93b6906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=2